{"synopsis":"\"Bajingan kriminal... Apa kau tidak bisa berpikir jernih?!\"\n\nYang kulakukan hanya memulai level tersulit terakhir dari game “Abyss of the Labyrinth”, dan aku malah berakhir menjadi karakter di dalam game \"Otherworld Possessor.\"\n\nYang lebih parah, karakter yang kuperankan adalah seorang kriminal yang dijadikan budak?!\n\nAkan tetapi, setiap kali aku menghadapi krisis, sebuah kemampuan sihir bernama “Turn-Bound Hourglass” aktif, aku dapat\nmembekukan waktu selama 60 detik...\n\nAku tidak tahu apak ini ulah pengembang game atau dewa yang iseng melemparkanku ke dalam kekacauan ini,\n\nTapi sebagai penyihir Turn-Bound,\naku akan bertahan hidup apapun yang terjadi.","alternative_title":"턴제의 마법사","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"b1cb802b-6e56-45a9-b720-26607fca844c","number":"53","chapter":"53","title":"","date":"2026-06-15","released":"2026-06-15","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d9cdd91a-bfcd-4f32-b7ec-beb81b728872/chapter_ch_1/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d9cdd91a-bfcd-4f32-b7ec-beb81b728872/chapter_ch_2/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d9cdd91a-bfcd-4f32-b7ec-beb81b728872/chapter_ch_3/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d9cdd91a-bfcd-4f32-b7ec-beb81b728872/chapter_ch_4/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d9cdd91a-bfcd-4f32-b7ec-beb81b728872/chapter_ch_5/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d9cdd91a-bfcd-4f32-b7ec-beb81b728872/chapter_ch_6/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d9cdd91a-bfcd-4f32-b7ec-beb81b728872/chapter_ch_7/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d9cdd91a-bfcd-4f32-b7ec-beb81b728872/chapter_ch_8/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d9cdd91a-bfcd-4f32-b7ec-beb81b728872/chapter_ch_9/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d9cdd91a-bfcd-4f32-b7ec-beb81b728872/chapter_ch_10/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d9cdd91a-bfcd-4f32-b7ec-beb81b728872/chapter_ch_11/11.webp","https://a